## Notes: KitnUI's configuration pages inside EllesmereUI.
## Author: Bitebtw
## Version: @project-version@
## Interface: 120005, 120007
## Dependencies: KitnUI, EllesmereUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Gift_05
## Group: KitnUI

# No SavedVariables line, deliberately. Switch states live in EllesmereUI's
# profile store and snapshots live in KitnUIDB, so this addon persists nothing of
# its own. Lite.NewDB wipes the global matching its svName, and KitnUI_EUIDB
# being undeclared is exactly what makes that wipe harmless.
EUITab.xml
